        "embedded_declaration": "[sub_resource type=\"GDScript\" id=6]\nscript/source = \"extends Sprite\n\nexport (NodePath) var objectPath\n\nonready var animaPlayer = $AnimationPlayer\nonready var object = get_node_or_null(objectPath)\n\nfunc _on_AnimationPlayer_animation_started(anim_name):\n\tif anim_name in [\\\"sweat\\\", \\\"angry\\\"]:\n\t\tvar direction\n\t\tvar emotive_parent := get_parent()\n\t\twhile !emotive_parent.has_method(\\\"get_direction\\\"):\n\t\t\temotive_parent = emotive_parent.get_parent()\n\t\tif emotive_parent.has_method(\\\"get_direction\\\"):\n\t\t\tdirection = emotive_parent.get_direction()\n\t\tif direction.x < 0:\n\t\t\tscale.x = -1\n\telse:\n\t\tscale.x = 1\n\nfunc set_bubble_offset():\n\tposition.y = -(object.texture.get_height() / object.vframes + 8)\n\t#print(position.y)\n\"\n__meta__ = {\n\"Scene_Path\": \"res://Nodes/Ui/emotes.tscn\"\n}\n\n",
